--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KFV §19: the uniform twiddle pass `twCU`*: `KFV.twC N r = dblI N (2r) ; rotC N (2r) ; unpadI N (2r) (4r)` carries the literals `N` and `2r`.
